[11993]="70042FC2\n1\tHelp Dagor\030Help Indir\tDagor and Indir stand within the keep in Arnach. Help Dagor and Indir to make any last-minute preparations that are needed before the attack.\n2\tTalk to Baranor\tBaranor stands within the keep in Arnach. You have helped Dagor and Indir to prepare against the oncoming Haradrim attack. You should return to Baranor to let him know that all is ready.\n3\tTalk to Baranor\tBaranor stands before the keep in Arnach. Baranor waits to speak to you, now that the fighting is done.\n",
[11994]="7002F9A4\n1\tDefiende Redilaldea con la ayuda de la Elfward\tEl Thane Elfmar espera en el Salón del Hidromiel de Redilaldea. Todas las habilidades de la Elfward de Redilaldea se pondrán a prueba al defender su hogar.\n2\tHabla con el Thane Elfmar\tPuedes encontrar a Elfmar en el Salón del Hidromiel de Redilaldea. El Thane Elfmar quiere hablar sobre el resultado de la batalla y el futuro de Redilaldea.\n",
[11995]="70019BD1\n1\tHabla con Bahanneth en Talan Fanuidhol\tBahanneth se encuentra en Talan Fanuidhol, hacia el norte. Se te ha encomendado hablar con Bahanneth, quien te indicará la mejor manera de ayudar a los defensores allí presentes a frustar las incursiones de los orcos que salen de Moria.\n",
[11996]="70029F55\n1\tHabla con Bron para defender Galtrev\tBron está en Galtrev. Habla con Bron para defender Galtrev.\n2\tHabla con Bron en Galtrev\tBron está en Galtrev en el marcador de hito en el centro del pueblo. Debes hablar con Bron para recoger la recompensa que has ganado al ayudar a defender Galtrev.\n",
[11997]="7004E4C5\n1\tTalk to Grámi Hornhelm\tGrámi Hornhelm can be found in Olin's Forge, in Hammerstead. You should talk to Grámi Hornhelm.\n2\tHelp Lóssi with 'Withstanding the Marauders'\030Help Lóssi with 'The Head of the Snake'\030Help Lóssi with 'Relieving the Guard'\030Help Grámi Hornhelm with 'Weapon Repossession'\tThere is work to do in defence of Hammerstead. You should complete quests in Hammerstead.\n3\tTalk to Grámi Hornhelm\tGrámi Hornhelm can be found in Hammerstead. You should talk to Grámi Hornhelm.\n4\tTalk to the Easterling prisoner\tAn Easterling is being held prisoner in Hammerstead. You should talk to the Easterling prisoner.\n5\tTalk to Grámi Hornhelm\tYou should talk to Grámi Hornhelm, who can be found in Hammerstead.\n6\tReturn to Járnfast with Tuhâl\tLord Náin needs to know about the Jangovar threat. You should return to Járnfast with Tuhâl.\n7\tBring Tuhâl before Lord Náin\tLord Náin needs to know about the Jangovar threat. You should bring Tuhâl before Lord Náin in Járnfast.\n8\tTalk to Tuhâl\tTuhâl is preparing to stand before Lord Náin and speak his piece. You should talk to Tuhâl.\n",
[11998]="700097D8\n1\tHabla con Pantescal\tLos vestigios de la Villa de los Brumbar están en Parth Aduial, al noreste de Tinnudir. Naethmunn te ha pedido que cruces el puente hacia tierra firme y sigas la línea de la costa hacia el norte hasta que veas algunos de los muros que quedan de la Villa de los Brumbar. Naethmunn te ha pedido que ayudes a Pantescal, quien está actualmente planeando la defensa de un punto importante de los Dúnedain contra una horda de boggarts.\n2\tHabla con Naethmunn\tNaethmunn está en el campamento de montaraces de Tinnudir, en Evendim, al suroeste de la Villa de los Brumbar. Has defendido la Villa de los Brumbar del grupo de boggarts que lo amenazaba y ahora deberías volver a Naethmunn con el relato de tu éxito.\n",
[11999]="700440E2\n1\tTalk to Mithrandir when you are ready to begin\tMithrandir is standing near the baths of Minas Tirith. The Enemy has begun the siege of Minas Tirith. You should speak to Mithrandir before the battle begins.\n2\tDefend the walls of Minas Tirith from the Enemy\tThe Enemy has begun the siege of Minas Tirith. You must hold against the Enemy's forces.\n3\tThe battle is not over. You should await Mithrandir and Imrahil's command.\t\n",
[12000]="700442C8\n1\tTalk to Mithrandir when you are ready to begin\tMithrandir is standing near the baths of Minas Tirith. The Enemy has begun the siege of Minas Tirith. You should speak to Mithrandir before the battle begins.\n2\tDefend the walls of Minas Tirith from the Enemy\tThe Enemy has begun the siege of Minas Tirith. You must hold against the Enemy's forces.\n3\tThe battle is not over. You should await Mithrandir and Imrahil's command.\t\n",
